{"id": "e1f87c5e53fff943", "field": "text", "ja": "Kildrathは物事を大げさに言いがちだ。たとえば『Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery』は400回以上盗まれている。\n\nAthenaeumの刻印が書物を守り、許可のない閲覧を防いでいるのだ。", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-gossip-sg3@2026-09-15", "imported": "2026-09-15"}, "english": {"hash": "e1f87c5e53fff943", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
